{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1061289/block/singleImage/3254044/df/01M67Z6H352N9YKZR3025XZK9X.webp?updatedAt=1793456254\"/><figcaption>西貢大網仔營地30歲男燒炭，網民報警救回一命。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>一名男子在 Threads 發文自稱在西貢大網仔營地內的咖啡色帳篷尋短，要求網民代為報警。警方於今日 (31 日 ) 凌晨零時 40 分接獲有關報案，到場後找到該名 30 歲姓黃男事主。他昏迷倒地，旁邊有燒過的炭，送往將軍澳醫院搶救後回復清醒。 警方稍後聯絡到與事主同齡的胡姓妻子，據悉二人有感情問題，事主不想離婚，不排除與事件有關。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T04:05:39.497050+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":197,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T03:15:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:30.718411+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:59:30.718411+00:00","content_hash":"f64b5a839fa4ea31430bee088aa441f69c4470c1a5f003f1162fcc6475a658b2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}